prompt:
Validate this Reformat transform against its metadata and requirements.

Volunteer reimbursements: a Reformat that retains only rows where approved is true. Copy claim_ref; set band to high when miles is at least 20, otherwise regular. Enrich retained rows: sign_label negative/zero/positive; size_label correction for negative, zero for 0, small for 1..19, medium for 20..39, large for 40..79, exceptional from 80. Assign priority 9/0/1/2/3/4 to those size labels in that order. review is true for negatives or at least 80. message is reconcile for negative, authorize from 80, otherwise standard. adjusted clamps the measure to 0..80. parity is even or odd.

REFORMAT metadata:
Input 0 RetentionInput0: claim_ref string required, approved boolean required, miles integer required
Output 0 RetentionOutput0: claim_ref string required, band string required, sign_label string required, size_label string required, priority integer required, review boolean required, message string required, adjusted integer required, parity string required

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    $out.0.claim_ref = $in.0.claim_ref;
    integer amount = $in.0.miles;
    string band = "regular";
    if (amount >= 20) {
        band = "high";
    }
    $out.0.band = band;
    string signLabel = "zero";
    if (amount < 0) {
        signLabel = "negative";
    } else if (amount >= 0) {
        signLabel = "positive";
    }
    string sizeLabel = "zero";
    integer priority = 0;
    if (amount < 0) {
        sizeLabel = "correction";
        priority = 9;
    } else if (amount == 0) {
        sizeLabel = "zero";
        priority = 0;
    } else if (amount < 20) {
        sizeLabel = "small";
        priority = 1;
    } else if (amount < 40) {
        sizeLabel = "medium";
        priority = 2;
    } else if (amount < 80) {
        sizeLabel = "large";
        priority = 3;
    } else {
        sizeLabel = "exceptional";
        priority = 4;
    }
    boolean reviewNeeded = false;
    string message = "standard";
    if (amount < 0) {
        reviewNeeded = true;
        message = "reconcile";
    } else if (amount >= 80) {
        reviewNeeded = true;
        message = "authorize";
    }
    integer adjustedAmount = amount;
    if (amount < 0) {
        adjustedAmount = 0;
    } else if (amount > 80) {
        adjustedAmount = 80;
    }
    string parityLabel = "odd";
    if (amount % 2 == 0) {
        parityLabel = "even";
    }
    $out.0.sign_label = signLabel;
    $out.0.size_label = sizeLabel;
    $out.0.priority = priority;
    $out.0.review = reviewNeeded;
    $out.0.message = message;
    $out.0.adjusted = adjustedAmount;
    $out.0.parity = parityLabel;
    if ($in.0.approved) return ALL;
    return SKIP;
}
