Mountain rescue pagers requires a Reformat audit of call_sign. Trim and uppercase it into canonical. Match the entire canonical string against [A-Z]{3}-[0-9]{2}; valid is false with reason missing for empty text, false with reason format for a nonmatching value, and true with reason accepted otherwise. Copy pager_key. The string is required and may be empty. Quantity classification: negative below 0, empty for 0, small for 1..9, normal for 10..99, bulk from 100; corresponding priority 9/0/1/2/3. action uses first applicable rule: repair for invalid code, reconcile for negative quantity, hold for zero, release otherwise. Positive quantities give pack_count = integer quotient by 10 and remainder = modulo 10; others give both 0. route uses first applicable rule: data for invalid code, finance for negative, bulk from 100, normal otherwise. review is true for invalid code, negative quantity, or at least 100.

REFORMAT metadata:
Input 0 IdentifierInput1: pager_key string required, call_sign string required, quantity integer required
Output 0 IdentifierOutput1: pager_key string required, canonical string required, valid boolean required, reason string required, quantity_class string required, action string required, pack_count integer required, remainder integer required, priority integer required, route string required, review boolean required

```ctl
//#CTL2
function integer transform() {
    string candidate = upperCase(trim($in.0.call_sign));
    boolean accepted = true;
    string reason = "accepted";
    if (isEmpty(candidate)) {
        accepted = false;
        reason = "missing";
    } else if (!(candidate ~= "[A-Z]{3}-[0-9]{2}")) {
        accepted = false;
        reason = "format";
    }
    $out.0.pager_key = $in.0.pager_key;
    $out.0.canonical = candidate;
    $out.0.valid = accepted;
    $out.0.reason = reason;
    integer units = $in.0.quantity;
    string quantityClass = "normal";
    integer priority = 2;
    if (units < 0) {
        quantityClass = "negative";
        priority = 9;
    } else if (units == 0) {
        quantityClass = "empty";
        priority = 0;
    } else if (units < 10) {
        quantityClass = "small";
        priority = 1;
    } else if (units >= 100) {
        quantityClass = "bulk";
        priority = 3;
    }
    string action = "release";
    if (!accepted) {
        action = "repair";
    } else if (units < 0) {
        action = "reconcile";
    } else if (units == 0) {
        action = "hold";
    }
    integer packs = 0;
    integer remainder = 0;
    if (units > 0) {
        packs = units / 10;
        remainder = units % 10;
    }
    boolean reviewNeeded = false;
    string route = "normal";
    if (!accepted) {
        reviewNeeded = true;
        route = "data";
    } else if (units <= 0) {
        reviewNeeded = true;
        route = "finance";
    } else if (units >= 100) {
        reviewNeeded = true;
        route = "bulk";
    }
    $out.0.quantity_class = quantityClass;
    $out.0.action = action;
    $out.0.pack_count = packs;
    $out.0.remainder = remainder;
    $out.0.priority = priority;
    $out.0.route = route;
    $out.0.review = reviewNeeded;
    return ALL;
}
