Validate this Normalizer transform against its metadata and requirements.

The revised loyalty balance mutation and expiry export follows this priority schedule, with left-to-right posting order.

1 | member_token equals null | UNMATCHED {delta=0, remaining=balance, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=true}
2 | activity equals "CANCEL" | empty
3 | earned < 0 or redeemed < 0 | ERROR {delta=0, remaining=balance, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=true}
4 | expires_on differs from null and expires_on < as_of and balance > 0 | EXPIRE {delta=-balance, remaining=0, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false} -> BALANCE {delta=0, remaining=0, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}
5 | redeemed > balance+earned | HOLD {delta=0, remaining=balance, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=true}
6 | activity equals "BONUS" and review | AUDIT {delta=0, remaining=balance+earned, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=true} -> EARN {delta=earned, remaining=balance+earned, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false} -> BONUS {delta=earned*3, remaining=balance+earned*4, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}
7 | earned > 0 and redeemed > 0 | EARN {delta=earned, remaining=balance+earned, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false} -> SPEND {delta=-redeemed, remaining=balance+earned-redeemed, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false} -> BALANCE {delta=0, remaining=balance+earned-redeemed, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}
8 | earned > 0 | EARN {delta=earned, remaining=balance+earned, valid_until=expires_on, needs_review=false}
9 | otherwise | empty

Integers represent indivisible points. Use long arithmetic for balance changes. valid_until preserves expires_on, including absence. as_of and expiry timestamps use UTC. EARN then SPEND then BALANCE is a three-entry business package even without review.

Input 0 Source_loyalty_1: string activity_id [required]
string member_token [nullability omitted]
string activity [required]
integer earned [required]
integer redeemed [required]
long balance [required]
date expires_on [nullable]
date as_of [required]
boolean review [required].
Output 0 Posting_loyalty_1: string source_activity_id [required]
string point_action [required]
long delta [required]
long remaining [required]
date valid_until [nullable]
boolean needs_review [required].
Source activity_id values are unique. Preserve each in source_activity_id on its postings.

