3 | disposition equals "RESTOCK" and audit | CREDIT amount item_value*(100-25)/100; FEE amount item_value*25/100; AUDIT amount 0
4 | freight > item_value | FREIGHT amount freight-item_value
5 | disposition equals "RESTOCK" | CREDIT amount item_value*(100-25)/100; FEE amount item_value*25/100
6 | otherwise | CREDIT amount item_value-freight

Input 0 (In_return_settlement_1): source_return_id = string; accepts null: no | disposition = string; accepts null: no | item_value = decimal; accepts null: no | freight = decimal; accepts null: no | audit = boolean; accepts null: no | inspection_note string (nullability omitted).
Output 0 (Out_return_settlement_1): origin_return_ref = string; accepts null: no | settlement = string; accepts null: no | value = decimal; accepts null: no.
