Port 0 supplies proposals; port 1 supplies only current stored versions. broker_id is the ascending, unique, non-null join key on each side. Proposal columns are broker_id:string, tier:string?, commission:decimal?. Stored records add version_sk:long. Output is broker_id:string, close_sk:long, close_tier:string?, close_commission:decimal?, open_tier:string?, open_commission:decimal?, changed:boolean. Question marks mark nullable columns; the rest are required.

